%% Dogfood task 3 (round 3 in canvas/docs/dogfood-synthesis.md): a 15-node
%% BST, the search path for key 11 highlighted (nodes and edges), the in-order
%% array below it with index labels 0-14, lo/hi pointers at indices 8 and 11,
%% and a caption. The brief also wants each array cell under its tree node's
%% column; Mermaid cannot express that, so it is a layout requirement for the
%% compiler, not part of this source.
